Package: tind-installer
Version: 0.1.10
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: calamares, calamares-settings-debian, tind-branding, zenity
Installed-Size: 80
Description: Tind branding for the Calamares installer
 Branding component for Calamares (logo, welcome image, sidebar colours and a
 three-slide installation slideshow) and a postinst that points Calamares at it.
 It is only on the live image: it also hides Tind Apps there (an installed
 Tind has Tind Apps and no installer entry), and is removed after installing.
